        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DarkVein</strong> is a <strong>third-person tactical RPG</strong> set in a vast open world filled with life, mystery, and danger.<br>Amid dense forests, lakes, and ancient ruins lurks a threat — <strong>infected creatures</strong> that were once human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must <strong>survive</strong>, <strong>build shelters</strong>, <strong>gather resources</strong>, and <strong>fight for every day</strong>.<br>Combat relies on <strong>tactics, stamina management</strong>, and <strong>environmental awareness</strong>, where even nature itself can become an ally — or an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DarkVein</strong> blends a sense of <strong>calm and danger</strong>, turning every journey into a fight for survival.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DarkVein</strong> is a <strong>third-person tactical RPG</strong> set in a vast open world filled with life, mystery, and danger.<br>Amid dense forests, lakes, and ancient ruins lurks a threat — <strong>infected creatures</strong> that were once human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must <strong>survive</strong>, <strong>build shelters</strong>, <strong>gather resources</strong>, and <strong>fight for every day</strong>.<br>Combat relies on <strong>tactics, stamina management</strong>, and <strong>environmental awareness</strong>, where even nature itself can become an ally — or an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DarkVein</strong> blends a sense of <strong>calm and danger</strong>, turning every journey into a fight for survival.</p>",
